Description: terminal file manager with SMB/NFS/SFTP/MTP support
 Two-pane file manager for the terminal, talking directly to removable
 media, MTP devices, SMB, NFS and SFTP shares and Google Drive, Dropbox
 and Microsoft OneDrive accounts, with background tasks, archives, a
 clipboard shared with the desktop and local semantic search on file
 contents with Vulkan GPU acceleration.
 .
 Registers with the desktop as a file manager next to the others (opening
 folders, "Show in folder", the file chooser portal) and lists its network
 sources in GTK file dialogs; which file manager is used stays the
 system's choice.
